  "description": "LOTFOR crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C90 H84 Eu4 F12 N12 O12,2(C6 H14 O3). From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 4 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu4 (Eu) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.580-4.371 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.71-134.22°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Eu4(FForm)6(μ-OH)2(μ3-O2)2(diglyme)2]·2diglyme.",
